      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðon ðe his freot forwyrce.] [Ld] Gif hwa þurh stæltihtlan freot forwryce ⁊ his hand on hand sylle, ⁊ hine his magas forlætan, ⁊ he nyte, hwa him forebete, ðonne sy he ðæs ðeowweorces wyrðe, ðe ðærto gebyrige; ⁊ oðfealle se wer ðam magum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If any man, through [being found guilty of] an accusation of stealing, forfeits his freedom and gives up his person to his lord, and his kinsmen forsake him, and he knows no one who will make legal amends for him, he shall do such servile labour as may be required, and his kinsmen shall have no right to his wergeld [if he is slain].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa ðurh stæltihtlan freot forwryce ⁊ his hand on hand sylle, ⁊ hine his magas forlætan, ⁊ he nite, hwa him forebete, ðonne sy he ðæs ðeowweorces wyrðe, ðe ðærto gebyrige; ⁊ oðfealle se wer ðam magum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
